---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-kent-blue">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last Updated: October 2024</p>
    
    <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 text-justify">
      <p>By booking a service or using this website, you agree to the following Terms & Conditions of <strong>24x7 RO Support</strong>.</p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">1. Service Nature</h2>
        <p>24x7 RO Support is an independent, third-party multi-brand RO repair and service center. We are not an authorized service partner of any brand mentioned on this website. We provide out-of-warranty and general repair services using compatible or genuine parts.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">2. Pricing & Payments</h2>
        <p>A basic visit/diagnosis charge of <strong>₹299</strong> applies. This amount is waived off if you choose to proceed with the repair. The final repair cost (including spare parts) will be quoted by the technician before starting the work. We do not take advance payments online.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">3. Warranty Policy</h2>
        <p>We provide a <strong>90-day warranty</strong> on replaced spare parts. This warranty is void if:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>The purifier is physically damaged after the repair.</li>
          <li>The issue occurs due to severe voltage fluctuations.</li>
          <li>Any third-party technician attempts to open or modify the purifier after our service.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">4. Cancellations & Rescheduling</h2>
        <p>You may cancel or reschedule your booking by calling us directly at 08062180546. No cancellation fee is charged if done before the technician is dispatched.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>24x7 RO Support is not liable for any indirect damages caused due to pre-existing electrical issues, water leakage from old pipes, or structural damage at the customer's premises during the standard course of service.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>